                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Tires are one of the most expensive wear items on any semi truck, and one of the easiest to damage. Running with incorrect air pressure, ignoring tread wear, or skipping rotations can lead to blowouts and poor fuel economy. How to fix it:",
