                  "id": "p-mistake-3-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "That small engine light might not seem urgent, until it becomes one. Ignoring dashboard warnings or minor performance issues often leads to major repairs later. Something as simple as a clogged fuel filter can put added strain on the entire system, leading to injector or turbocharger failure. Modern trucks are equipped with advanced diagnostics for a reason. When a light comes on, take it seriously. Early intervention saves both time and money.",
