                },
                {
                  "id": "p-mistake-6-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Oil and fluid changes aren't just routine; they're essential. Delayed oil changes can cause buildup and engine wear, while neglected coolant or transmission fluid can lead to overheating and costly internal damage. Every make and model has its own interval recommendations, and operating conditions (like Florida's heat) can shorten those timelines. Don't rely solely on mileage. Monitor condition, color, and viscosity. Recommended fluids to track:",
